{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte \u00e0 la Mer \u00c9g\u00e9e", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Des mythes grecs", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Exploring Ancient Sites > The Great Wall", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage d'une information pr\u00e9cise concernant le travail et les lieux de travail des gens dans des situations communicatives.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 et l'imparfait", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "On peut exprimer le pass\u00e9 de deux fa\u00e7ons : le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 et l'imparfait.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imparfait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure&nbsp;:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verbe auxiliaire au pr\u00e9sent de l'indicatif + participe pass\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le radical du verbe + terminaison\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fonction&nbsp;:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"des actions commenc\u00e9es et termin\u00e9es dans le pass\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"des actions r\u00e9p\u00e9t\u00e9es, des habitudes ou des descriptions au pass\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbes irr\u00e9guliers&nbsp;:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nombreux\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"peu nombreux\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple&nbsp;:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"j'ai march\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je marchais\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "\u00c0 l'\u00e9poque ancienne, les Grecs croyaient que les dieux \u00e9taient comme des gens normaux.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Parmi toutes les femmes, Pers\u00e9phone \u00e9tait la plus belle. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Un jour, Had\u00e8s, le roi des Enfers, l'a kidnapp\u00e9e et l'a amen\u00e9e \u00e0 son monde d'en bas.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "La comparaison", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le comparatif permet de comparer deux personnes ou deux choses. Pour cela, on utilise la structure <span class=\"strong\">plus/moins...que</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Parmi toutes les femmes, Pers\u00e9phone \u00e9tait la plus belle. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Il est moins int\u00e9ressant de visiter le Canada en hiver.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Il fait plus chaud en Gr\u00e8ce qu'au Canada.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Le superlatif sert \u00e0 exprimer le niveau \u00e9lev\u00e9 de quelque chose. On distingue le superlatif de sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9 et le superlatif d'inf\u00e9riorit\u00e9. Pour former le superlatif, il suffit d'ajouter un article d\u00e9fini (<span class=\"strong\">le</span>, <span class=\"strong\">la</span>, <span class=\"strong\">les</span>) devant <span class=\"strong\">plus</span> et <span class=\"strong\">moins</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlatif\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le plus/la plus/les plus + adjectif (+de)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">C'est la plus grande ville. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Inf\u00e9riorit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le moins/la moins/les moins +&nbsp;adjectif (+ de)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">C'est la voiture la moins belle.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Il existe des superlatifs irr\u00e9guliers, ce sont les m\u00eames que les comparatifs irr\u00e9guliers. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectif/Adverbe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlatif\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le meilleur/la meilleure/les meilleurs/les meilleures\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mauvais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le pire/la pire/les pires\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bien\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le mieux/la mieux/les mieux\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour parler d'un mythe. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le mythe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "r\u00e9cit imaginaire ; l\u00e9gende", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Un des ces mythes tourne au sujet de Pers\u00e9phone. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fleurir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "produire des fleurs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les fleurs attendent le retour de Pers\u00e9phone avant de fleurir au printemps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "les Enfers", "type": "name"}, {"content": "lieu sous terre o\u00f9 s\u00e9journent les damn\u00e9s apr\u00e8s leur mort", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom. m./pl.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Un jour, Had\u00e8s, le roi des Enfers, l'a kidnapp\u00e9 et l'a amen\u00e9 \u00e0 son monde d'en bas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le dieu, la d\u00e9esse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00eatre divin", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les Grecs croyaient que les dieux \u00e9taient comme des gens normaux. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pleurer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "verser des larmes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Pers\u00e9phone a pleur\u00e9. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la disparition", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fait de ne plus \u00eatre visible ; fait d'\u00eatre perdu ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : D\u00e9m\u00e9ter a pleur\u00e9 la disparition de sa fille et s'est f\u00e2ch\u00e9e contre Had\u00e8s.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le caract\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personnalit\u00e9 individuelle", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Sarah a un fort caract\u00e8re. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la moralit\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "valeurs \u00e9thiques d'une personne", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils n'\u00e9taient pas sup\u00e9rieurs aux humains en caract\u00e8re ou en moralit\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la vengeance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "revanche", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils jouaient des tours, ils se f\u00e2chaient, ils prenaient la vengeance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'agriculture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "culture de la terre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : D\u00e9m\u00e9ter, la m\u00e8re de Pers\u00e9phone et d\u00e9esse de l'agriculture, a pleur\u00e9 la disparition de sa fille et s'est f\u00e2ch\u00e9e contre Had\u00e8s.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le05ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choisissez deux sujets qui peuvent \u00eatre compar\u00e9s, comme des pays, des produits ou des services.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "R\u00e9fl\u00e9chissez aux diff\u00e9rences et aux ressemblances.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez les structures \"la/le plus...\" ou \"plus/moins...que\".", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez cinq phrases pour comparer ces pays, produits ou services. \u00c9crivez un total de 40 \u00e0 50 mots. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Pr\u00e9cisez quel pays, produit ou service vous pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez et expliquez pourquoi.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez vos phrases \u00e0 votre camarade.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris des phrases pour comparer deux sujets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise diff\u00e9rentes structures pour exprimer la comparaison.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'exprime mes pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences et je donne des raisons.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je lis les phrases \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 2, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le05ob01re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le05ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le05ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le05ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "\u00c0 l'\u00e9poque ancienne, les Grecs croyaient que les dieux \u00e9taient comme des gens normaux. Ils n'\u00e9taient pas sup\u00e9rieurs aux humains en caract\u00e8re ou en moralit\u00e9. Ils jouaient des tours, ils se f\u00e2chaient, ils se vengeaient. Tous ces traits de personnalit\u00e9  des dieux sont pr\u00e9sents dans l'histoire de Pers\u00e9phone. <br>"}, {"time": "15300", "image": "frn5le05ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Parmi toutes les femmes, Pers\u00e9phone \u00e9tait la plus belle. Un jour, Had\u00e8s, le roi des Enfers, l'a kidnapp\u00e9e et l'a amen\u00e9e dans son monde d'en bas.<br><br>D\u00e9m\u00e9ter, la m\u00e8re de Pers\u00e9phone et d\u00e9esse de l'agriculture, a pleur\u00e9 la disparition de sa fille et s'est f\u00e2ch\u00e9e contre Had\u00e8s.  Dans sa col\u00e8re, la culture devenait impossible. Graduellement, la terre s'est refroidie et les jours se sont raccourcis. C'\u00e9tait l'hiver. <br>"}, {"time": "42500", "image": "frn5le05ob01re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Pers\u00e9phone a pleur\u00e9. Finalement, Had\u00e8s a c\u00e9d\u00e9. Il a permis \u00e0 Pers\u00e9phone de retourner sur la terre, mais en exigeant son retour chaque ann\u00e9e.<br><br>Depuis ce temps, les fleurs attendent le retour de Pers\u00e9phone avant de fleurir au printemps. L'automne venu, elle repart aux Enfers. D\u00e9m\u00e9ter pleure sa fille et le monde retourne \u00e0 l'hiver. Ceci explique le changement des saisons. <br>"}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux employer des expressions au pass\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux raconter des \u00e9v\u00e9nements au pass\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux comparer des choses.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quels mythes grecs ou romains connaissez-vous&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quels sont les mythes de votre culture&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "On en apprend sur les mythes grecs et romains&nbsp;!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"stimuli_ids": [2], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pers\u00e9phone est envoy\u00e9e aux Enfers. Pourquoi ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_fe